ons.\n\nAs a script executes, Pine’s runtime system stores data for each variable and expression across bars in fixed-length [historical buffers","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language/execution-model/#historical-buffers","line":79},{"title":"built-in functions","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language/built-ins/#built-in-functions","line":83},{"title":"close","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-reference/v6/#var_close","line":83},{"title":"runtime error","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/errors/RE10143/#the-requested-historical-offset-x-is-beyond-the-historical-buffers-limit-y","line":87},{"title":"max\\_bars\\_back()","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-reference/v6/#fun_max_bars_back","line":91},{"title":"historical buffer limit","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/errors/RE10143/#the-requested-historical-offset-x-is-beyond-the-historical-buffers-limit-y","line":94},{"title":"Execution model","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language/execution-model/","line":94},{"title":"Historical buffers","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language/execution-model/#historical-buffers","line":94},{"title":"​`timeframe`​ and ​`timeframe_gaps`​","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language/declaration-statements/\\#timeframe-and-timeframe_gaps","line":96},{"title":"timeframe string","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/concepts/timeframes/#timeframe-string-specifications","line":98},{"title":"indicator()","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-reference/v6/#fun_indicator","line":98},{"title":"`gaps`","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/concepts/other-timeframes-and-data/#gaps","line":100},{"title":"request.security()","target":"https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-reference/v6/#fun_request.security","line":100},{"title":"na","target":"https://www.tradingvi